\n\t \r\n\t\t \r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Accountant \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t The Town of Norton, Massachusetts, is responsible for the careful accounting and stewardship of public funds. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Animal Control \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t Connect with Animal Control to find information and contacts for keeping your pets and family healthy and safe. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Assessor \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t View the current tax rates, forms and applications, instructions, maps, and contact information for the Assessor's Office staff and board members. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Board of Health \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t The goal of the Board of Health is to protect and enhance the community's health by enforcing state and local public health and environmental regulations. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Building Inspector \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t The Building & Inspections Department is responsible for ensuring that buildings are constructed safely and used properly, conducting annual inspections, and issuing permits for new construction, reconstruction, alteration, repair, and demolition of buildings as well as the installation of equipment & the location, use & occupancy of all buildings, structures, and land. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Conservation \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t The Norton Conservation Commission is a seven-member board of volunteers whose goal is to protect the ecological integrity of Norton's wetlands and surrounding landscape. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Council on Aging & Human Services \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t Our mission is to enrich the lives of Norton's senior residents by identifying needs and providing programs, activities, outreach, and resources to promote healthy living and to enrich the quality of life. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Department of Public Works \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t Department of Public Works \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Fire Department \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t The mission of the Norton Fire-Rescue Department is to protect lives and property by providing exceptional customer service and the highest quality fire suppression, emergency medical care, rescue, fire prevention, and public education services to our community. We are committed to continuous improvement and providing our services in a safe, effective, and efficient manner. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Information Technology  \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t To support, maintain, and promote the use of technology for all town offices and departments to enhance their job productivity and efficiency. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Library \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t Search the card catalog, renew your items, or join us for an event at the library. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Moderator \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t View contact information and more of the Town Moderator. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Norton Emergency Management Agency (NEMA) \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t To further the education of the citizens of Norton in the ability to avert or combat the effects of a disaster, either natural or man-made. Coordinate the resources of those State, Federal, and Volunteer agencies that respond to our needs when local resources are overwhelmed. To ensure that the citizens affected by the disaster are cared for, they receive financial assistance and emotional support to provide a full recovery. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Human Resources \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t Learn about the Town of Norton’s Payroll and Employee Benefits services, including compensation, health insurance, retirement plans, and other resources for municipal employees. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Planning & Economic Development \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t Our Department provides planning and economic resources for the Town of Norton. We are staff to the Planning Board, Zoning Board of Appeals and Economic Development Commission and help the public work with these groups. As the economic development arm of the Town, we have many business and economic resources. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Police Department \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t The mission of the Norton Police Department is to protect and serve the residents and business community of Norton by delivering the highest quality police service with professionalism and integrity. We strive to maintain and enhance the qualities of life by effective Community Policing, while at the same time enforcing the laws fairly and impartially. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Storm Water \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t Discover how the Town of Norton manages storm water through local programs, regulations, and best practices designed to protect water quality, reduce flooding, and support environmental sustainability. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Town Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t The Norton Town Clerk's Office is committed to providing courteous, competent, and efficient customer service.  We are dedicated to thoroughly preserving the town's vital records and historical documents for the benefit of future generations. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Town Manager \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t Find contact information for the Town Manager and Select Board.  \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Treasurer / Tax Collector \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t The Treasurer/Tax Collector's Office will provide taxpayers and town      employees with professional and courteous customer service. We will         answer all inquiries in a timely manner.  We will continue to persevere to treat all taxpayers with equity and take all necessary steps as required by Massachusetts General Law to collect on all past due accounts. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Veterans' Services \r\n\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t OUt vision is to advocate for Norton veterans, dependents, and widows; providing access to every federal, state, and local service and benefit to which they are entitled. \r\n\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t \t\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\t\t \r\n\t \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\n\t \n\n\t\t \n\n\n\n\t   \r\n\r\n\t   \r\n\r\n\t\t\t   \r\n\r\n\r\n\t\t \r\n\r\n\t \r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t \r\n\r\n\t \r\n \r\n \t \r\n\t\t\t\t                \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\t \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\n \t \r\n\t\t\t\t                \r\n\r\n\t\t \r\t\t\t\t\n\t \r\r\n\t\n\t \r\t\r\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\t \n\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t \n\t \n\t\t \n\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t \r\n\r\n \r\n\t \r\n\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t \r\n\t \r\n \r\n\t\t .fancyButton46.fancyButton:link,.fancyButton46.fancyButton:visited, .fancyButton46div.fancyButton{\r\n\tbackground-image: url('/ImageRepository/Document?documentID=72');\r\n\tbackground-repeat: no-repeat;\r\n\tbackground-position: center 1em ;\r\nbackground-size: 120px;\ntransition: all .3s ease-in-out;}\r\n.fancyButton46.fancyButton:hover,.fancyButton46.fancyButton:focus,.fancyButton46.fancyButton:active,.fancyButton46.fancyButton.hover{\r\n\tbackground-image: url('/ImageRepository/Document?documentID=71');\r\n\tbackground-repeat: no-repeat;\r\n\tbackground-position: center top;\r\n}\r\n.fancyButton46.fancyButton:link > span,.fancyButton46.fancyButton:visited > span, .fancyButton46div.fancyButton > span{\r\n}\r\n.fancyButton46.fancyButton:hover > span,.fancyButton46.fancyButton:focus > span,.fancyButton46.fancyButton:active > span,.fancyButton46.fancyButton.hover > span{\r\n}\r\n.fancyButton46.fancyButton .text{\r\n\tcolor: rgb(0, 0, 0);\r\n\tfont-family: \"Lato\";\r\n\tpadding-top: 9